# Frontend Feature-Driven Rules
- Modules live in `src/features/<feature>/` with `components/`, `pages/`, `queries/`.
- Queries colocated: Types + Axios fetcher + React Query hook in `queries/`.
- No separate `types.ts` per feature. No `index.ts` barrel files. Direct imports standard.
- Always use `type` instead of `interface`.
- Consume network requests only via hooks in `queries/`, never raw Axios inside components.
- ALWAYS use Tailwind CSS utility classes (`className="..."`). NEVER use inline CSS (`style={{ ... }}`) or vanilla CSS classes unless an extreme dynamic calculation demands it.

